<details class="ewt-section ewt-help"><summary>How this is computed</summary><p>Includes posted payroll runs only, using the same compensation mapper as the 1601-C exporter. Draft and void runs are excluded. Non-taxable classifications follow recorded pay type, contributions and benefit splits. Missing or invalid amounts remain unknown and require review.</p><p>This is a summary of actual deductions and employer remittances, not a fresh monthly tax-table calculation or an employee refund determination. Reviewed adjustments and penalties come from saved returns; their credits do not automatically count as paid. Saved or filed snapshots remain unchanged when payroll changes.</p><p><a href="https://bir-cdn.bir.gov.ph/local/pdf/1601C%20final%20Jan%202018%20with%20DPA.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BIR Form 1601-C and instructions</a></p></details>
